OL,3,GNEWSAFormer paper mill could be 'jewel
OL,4,Ain town's crown'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in a harbour town have united as
OL,7,Fpart of a bid to see a paper mill
OL,8,Ftransformed into housing.
OL,10,FWansbrough paper mill in Watchet,
OL,11,FSomerset, was in operation from 1652 to
OL,12,F2015 and has been largely unused for 10
OL,13,Fyears. It was damaged in a serious fire
OL,14,Fin June.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
