OL,3,GNEWSAFormer paper mill could be 'jewel
OL,4,Ain town's crown'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome people think the 38-acre
OL,7,Fbrownfield site could become "the jewel
OL,8,Fin the crown for Watchet" and
OL,9,Faffordable housing there - alongside
OL,10,Ffacilities like restaurants - could
OL,11,Fbenefit local young people. Somerset
OL,12,FCouncil said it was "open" to
OL,13,Fdiscussions.
OL,15,FLizzie Fone, a trustee for Base for
OL,16,FLife Watchet, said: "Nobody wants to
OL,17,Fsee it [the mill] closed. We need more
OL,18,Fhousing, more infrastructure, that's
OL,19,Fsomething the mill site can provide."
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
